WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.373 --> 00:00:03.123
Unit one. My Body Parts!

2
00:00:04.076 --> 00:00:07.524
Hello, everyone! I'm Nurse Bopha, your school nurse.

3
00:00:07.574 --> 00:00:10.858
Hi, Nurse Bopha! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:10.908 --> 00:00:14.361
Today we learn about My Body Parts. Let's go!

5
00:00:15.461 --> 00:00:18.794
Head. Say it with me. Head!

6
00:00:22.290 --> 00:00:25.540
Hand. Say it with me. Hand!

7
00:00:29.040 --> 00:00:32.290
Foot. Say it with me. Foot!

8
00:00:35.774 --> 00:00:38.907
Eye. Say it with me. Eye!

9
00:00:42.407 --> 00:00:45.740
Ear. Say it with me. Ear!

10
00:00:49.264 --> 00:00:52.614
Nose. Say it with me. Nose!

11
00:00:56.120 --> 00:00:59.253
Mouth. Say it with me. Mouth!

12
00:01:02.744 --> 00:01:05.844
Body. Say it with me. Body!

13
00:01:09.342 --> 00:01:18.475
I have one head, two hands, and two feet. My eyes help me see, my ears help me hear, and my nose helps me smell. I take care of my whole body every day.

14
00:01:18.525 --> 00:01:19.763
I can do that too!

15
00:01:21.203 --> 00:01:26.398
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:26.448 --> 00:01:27.598
Foot!

17
00:01:28.358 --> 00:01:33.376
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:33.426 --> 00:01:34.576
Mouth!

19
00:01:35.353 --> 00:01:41.504
Did you know? Your heart is about the size of your fist, and it beats even while you sleep!

20
00:01:41.554 --> 00:01:43.550
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:44.252 --> 00:01:51.785
Think and answer. Can you name three parts of your body?

22
00:01:51.835 --> 00:01:52.985
Great answer!

23
00:01:54.317 --> 00:01:59.385
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:01:59.435 --> 00:02:02.217
Goodbye, everyone! Stay healthy!

